  "biography": {
    "plain_text": "Keijo Erik Rosberg, known as Keke, is a Finnish former racing driver who won the Formula One world championship with Williams in 1982. Born in Sweden to Finnish parents, he progressed through karting and international single-seater racing. He later founded Team Rosberg and helped guide other drivers into professional competition.",
